# .xxignore — repo-local agent context boundary.
#
# Paths listed here are excluded from agent context gathering, search, and
# "did you read the whole repo" completeness claims. This is about attention,
# not about version control: use .gitignore for what must not be committed.
#
# Syntax follows .gitignore conventions.

# Dependencies and build output — never useful as agent context.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Runtime state, logs, and captured telemetry.
hermes-orchestration/logs/
*.log

# Generated catalogs — read the generator, not the output.
**/DESIGN-CATALOG.md

# Large vendored design-system reference data. The design agents load these
# on demand via the design skills; they should not be swept into general
# context. Remove this entry if you are actively editing the design pack.
**/packs/design/design-systems/

# Local, machine-specific overrides.
.env
.env.*
*.local.json

# Live agent workspace: session traces and verbatim prompt history. Agent
# scratch, not repo content — sweeping it into context re-reads past sessions
# as if they were source. Also gitignored.
.skippy/
